{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Eh, shame.\" Kiln spaces out staring into the flames.","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:39:17.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739719020957401171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Takes a tough will to survive as such\" the young noble says, something telling in his features as if he could relate","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:40:11.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739719245407060008","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Is your abode near our perimeter?\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:40:25.917000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739719306195238992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Actually yes, I'm surprised none of you have stumbled upon it yet.\" She points over to the trees near the edge of town \"My cottage is just over in that grove.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:41:40.402000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739719618607710219","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"It certainly is a pleasure to see a friendly face outside of the other colonists here.\" He remarks","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:43:22.451000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739720046632501278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"We have begun to set up various manufactories for magics and the like, you should come to town to peruse the wares sometime\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:43:57.762000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739720194737307728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"I would like to meet the others if I can. While I do have some friends here... it's different.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:44:44.171000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739720389390893107","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"For a moment Riga's shade paces back and forth, then he continues \"It would be quite wonderful if you were to accompany us on some expeditions deeper into the island. It would be a good opportunity to meet the rest of the colonists, and explore the island for yourself. That... and we could use someone with diplomatic experience\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:46:45.952000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739720900177297470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"It seems like Riga has some beef with the word *diplomacy*","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:47:36.980000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739721114204504067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"She looks into the fire thinking \"I could.. but I'm not a diplomat, I just worked under one.\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:48:25.153000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739721316256579665","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"If Rigatony was bothered by the statement, it doesn't show on his face. His shade however, disappears into the forest.","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:49:28.748000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-03T05:50:13.304000Z","id":"739721582993342515","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"733827592045461538","content":"\"Nevertheless, it would be a pleasure to have you along\"","created_at":"2020-08-03T05:49:39.069000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739721626282885130","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
